{"questionId":"u02-s015-v001","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"某社團 48 人中有 3/8 參加服務組。服務組有多少人？","choices":["18 人","16 人","20 人","24 人"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"服務組人數是 48 人的 3/8，計算 48×3/8。先用 48÷8=6，再乘 3 得 18，所以服務組有 18 人；18/48 約分也等於 3/8。先除後乘可保持整數運算，且答案沒有超過總人數。","steps":["依題意列式 48×3/8。","先算 48÷8=6，再算 6×3=18。","用 18/48=3/8 驗證比例。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"18 人","truth":true,"reason":"18人正確。"},{"choice":"16 人","truth":false,"reason":"這是1/3。"},{"choice":"20 人","truth":false,"reason":"多算2人。"},{"choice":"24 人","truth":false,"reason":"這是1/2。"}],"commonMistake":"把總人數四十八先除以分子三再乘分母八，將分率的分子與分母作用顛倒。","concept":"部分量=總量×所佔分率。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"整數與分率的基本情境。","literacyContextNecessity":"社團總人數與服務組比例共同決定實際人數。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"b75c5a736dadd28f909ee49cda5d44a6163c13ae3dab933a7e82759b2b9d56c0","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v002","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"食品標示每份含糖 12 公克，一盒有 5又1/2 份。整盒含糖多少公克？","choices":["60 公克","66 公克","72 公克","78 公克"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"一盒有 5又1/2 份，也就是 5.5 份。每份含糖 12 公克，整盒為 12×5.5=66 公克；也可算五份 60 公克加半份 6 公克。份數乘每份含糖量才是整盒總量，計算後單位仍為公克。","steps":["把 5又1/2 份換成 5.5 份。","計算 12×5.5=66 公克。","以 5 份加半份的糖量 60+6 驗算。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"60 公克","truth":false,"reason":"只算5份。"},{"choice":"66 公克","truth":true,"reason":"66公克正確。"},{"choice":"72 公克","truth":false,"reason":"把半份算成1份。"},{"choice":"78 公克","truth":false,"reason":"12×5又1/2=66公克；78公克不符合每份12公克的乘法。"}],"commonMistake":"忽略另外的半份而只算五份，或把五又二分之一直接取整為六份。","concept":"每份量乘份數可含帶分數。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"讀取營養標示。","literacyContextNecessity":"每份含糖量與盒內份數共同決定整盒含糖量。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"37e0ae0b24e2f9935893ab6ca600bc3185e7b82ae2e1a9980fa86c5d03939756","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v003","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"活動每 12 天一次，今天舉行後，第 60 天是否會再舉行？","choices":["不會，因60不是12的因數","不會，因60小於12²","會，因60是12的倍數","資訊不足"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"活動每 12 天一次，今天之後的舉行日是 12 的正倍數。60÷12=5 沒有餘數，所以第 60 天正好是第五個週期，會再次舉行；應判斷倍數而不是因數。","steps":["以週期 12 天檢查第 60 天。","計算 60÷12=5，餘數為 0。","判定第 60 天是第五個週期，活動會舉行。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"不會，因60不是12的因數","truth":false,"reason":"因數方向讀反。"},{"choice":"不會，因60小於12²","truth":false,"reason":"12²與週期無關。"},{"choice":"會，因60是12的倍數","truth":true,"reason":"60是12的倍數。"},{"choice":"資訊不足","truth":false,"reason":"資料足夠。"}],"commonMistake":"把週期日是否出現誤判成六十是不是十二的因數，而不是檢查六十是否為十二的倍數。","concept":"事件日是週期的倍數。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"用倍數判斷週期日。","literacyContextNecessity":"週期12天與指定第60天共同決定是否落在活動時點。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"a8cd513f39ee8130c32aa2e5bf55b0e2eb9263d138e11f27b65e6d382a2cd103","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v004","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"一批貨物先出貨全數的 2/5，再出貨剩餘的 1/3。最後剩原數的多少？","choices":["2/15","3/5","7/15","2/5"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"第一次出貨全數的 2/5，剩下原數的 3/5。第二次出剩餘量的 1/3，表示保留剩餘量的 2/3，所以最後剩 3/5×2/3=2/5。第二次是以第一次後的剩餘量為基準，不能直接從全數再減三分之一。","steps":["第一次出貨後剩原數的 1−2/5=3/5。","第二次出剩餘的 1/3，因此保留剩餘的 2/3。","相乘 3/5×2/3=2/5，得到最後比例。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"2/15","truth":false,"reason":"這是第二次出貨佔原量。"},{"choice":"3/5","truth":false,"reason":"只算第一次剩餘。"},{"choice":"7/15","truth":false,"reason":"把兩次出貨比例直接相加。"},{"choice":"2/5","truth":true,"reason":"最後剩2/5。"}],"commonMistake":"把第二次『剩餘的三分之一』改成原數的三分之一，忽略基準已在第一次後更新。","concept":"連續比例的基準會改變，要乘保留倍率。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"處理變動基準的分率。","literacyContextNecessity":"第二次比例明確以剩餘量為基準，不能與第一次直接相加。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"18cd647d31fdd391f5c0eab1e3bd582973196b0bc8eca28cb574e793fb9f5015","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v005","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"店家進貨 240 件，第一週售出 35%，第二週售出原進貨量的 1/4。尚餘多少件？","choices":["96 件","84 件","120 件","156 件"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"第一週售出 240×35%=84 件；第二週明定以原進貨量為基準，售出 240×1/4=60 件。尚餘 240−84−60=96 件，兩週共售 144 件。把售出的一百四十四件與剩餘九十六件相加，正好回到原進貨量。","steps":["計算第一週售出 240×0.35=84 件。","計算第二週售出原量的 1/4，即 60 件。","用 240−84−60 得尚餘 96 件。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"96 件","truth":true,"reason":"第一週售 84 件、第二週售 60 件，240−84−60=96 件。"},{"choice":"84 件","truth":false,"reason":"84 件是第一週售出量，誤把中間量當成兩週後尚餘量。"},{"choice":"120 件","truth":false,"reason":"把 84+60 誤加成 120，再算 240−120 才會得到 120 件。"},{"choice":"156 件","truth":false,"reason":"156 件是只扣除第一週 84 件後的剩餘量，漏掉第二週售出的 60 件。"}],"commonMistake":"把第二週的四分之一錯以第一週售後剩餘量為基準，而不是題目指定的原進貨量。","concept":"同題不同百分率可能使用同一或不同基準，須讀文字。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"混合百分率與分數。","literacyContextNecessity":"進貨量、第一週百分率和第二週以原量為基準的分率共同決定剩餘庫存。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"09bc755d7606cae89981e057d38dbc8e6d0c6bcd1316e8509f5ac9608862417d","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v006","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"兩臺裝置分別每 18、24 分鐘檢查一次，上午 8:00 同時檢查。上午 10:30 前（含10:30）再同時檢查幾次？","choices":["1 次","2 次","3 次","4 次"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"18 與 24 的最小公倍數為 72 分鐘，所以共同檢查週期是 72 分鐘。由 8:00 起依序為 9:12、10:24、11:36；10:30 前含端點只有前兩次。起始的八點不算題目所問的之後時刻，十一點三十六也已超出範圍。","steps":["求 lcm(18,24)=72 分鐘。","由 8:00 每隔 72 分鐘列出 9:12、10:24、11:36。","依 10:30 前的範圍計數，得到 2 次。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1 次","truth":false,"reason":"漏算10:24。"},{"choice":"2 次","truth":true,"reason":"兩次正確。"},{"choice":"3 次","truth":false,"reason":"多算11:36前不存在時刻。"},{"choice":"4 次","truth":false,"reason":"把每36分鐘算共同。"}],"commonMistake":"只求出共同週期七十二分鐘卻未列實際時刻，因而漏算或多算指定區間內次數。","concept":"同步週期與時間區間要共同處理。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"週期與時刻綜合。","literacyContextNecessity":"兩週期、起始時刻及截止時刻共同決定同步次數。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"9ececad8415adf40195993b03dbe30add0002c76186d4924f850cf7bc39360be","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v007","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"某班男生佔全班的 5/12，女生比男生多 8 人。全班有多少人？","choices":["36 人","42 人","48 人","60 人"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"男生佔全班 5/12，女生便佔 7/12，女生比男生多全班的 2/12=1/6。已知這個差是 8 人，所以全班人數為 8÷1/6=48 人。驗算男生二十人、女生二十八人，相差八人且合計四十八人。","steps":["算出女生比例 1−5/12=7/12。","男女差為 7/12−5/12=1/6 全班。","由 1/6 全班=8 人，求得全班 48 人。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"36 人","truth":false,"reason":"全班36人時男女差為36×(2/12)=6人，不符合相差8人。"},{"choice":"42 人","truth":false,"reason":"1/6×42=7。"},{"choice":"48 人","truth":true,"reason":"48人正確。"},{"choice":"60 人","truth":false,"reason":"差10人。"}],"commonMistake":"直接用八人除以男生比例十二分之五，沒有先求女生與男生所佔比例的差。","concept":"差額對應兩比例之差。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"由部分比例差反求總量。","literacyContextNecessity":"男女比例互補且人數差8，兩者共同建立1/6全班=8。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"388a807a38f7e740d64d4acb7dd207761f9d992823295007a2e1d8f0562ffd8c","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v008","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"商品原價未知，先打八折再加 5% 稅，實付 1680 元。原價是多少？","choices":["1900 元","1950 元","2100 元","2000 元"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"先打八折再加 5% 稅，總倍率是 0.8×1.05=0.84。實付 1680 元等於原價的 84%，所以原價=1680÷0.84=2000 元；代回可還原實付。稅是按折後價計算，因此不能把折扣率與稅率直接相減。","steps":["合併折扣與稅的倍率 0.8×1.05=0.84。","列式 1680=原價×0.84。","計算原價 1680÷0.84=2000 元並代回驗證。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1900 元","truth":false,"reason":"1900×0.84=1596。"},{"choice":"1950 元","truth":false,"reason":"1950×0.84=1638。"},{"choice":"2100 元","truth":false,"reason":"2100×0.84=1764。"},{"choice":"2000 元","truth":true,"reason":"2000×0.84=1680。"}],"commonMistake":"把折扣百分之二十與稅率百分之五直接相減成百分之十五，錯用零點八五倍率。","concept":"連續價格變化用倍率相乘，再反除。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"折扣加稅反求原價。","literacyContextNecessity":"折扣、稅率與實付金額共同決定原價，計算順序不可交換為百分點加減。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"360aca16bdc4077fa81272a60a47bf26b9988490732cb3c62f4997827ced7b68","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v009","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"A、B 兩條路長度比為 3:5。A 已完成 4/5，B 已完成 3/4。兩路已完成長度比為何？","choices":["16:25","4:5","9:16","12:25"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"設 A、B 全長分別為 3k、5k。完成長度為 3k×4/5=12k/5 與 5k×3/4=15k/4；兩者比為 (12/5):(15/4)=48:75=16:25。完成率必須分別乘各自全長，再比較實際完成長度；只比較四分之五與四分之三會漏掉原總量差異。","steps":["依全長比設 A=3k、B=5k。","分別乘完成率，得 12k/5 與 15k/4。","相除並化簡比值，得到 16:25。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"16:25","truth":true,"reason":"16:25正確。"},{"choice":"4:5","truth":false,"reason":"只比較完成分率。"},{"choice":"9:16","truth":false,"reason":"比例計算錯。"},{"choice":"12:25","truth":false,"reason":"漏乘原長度比。"}],"commonMistake":"只比較兩路完成率五分之四與四分之三，忽略兩條路的全長原本不同。","concept":"實際完成量=總量比例×完成分率。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"比例與分率整合。","literacyContextNecessity":"原長度比與各自完成率共同決定實際完成長度比。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"7c3b7bd807a8234f21ec7de9c0c455b7a08188ca1806cc68bf23b40393d4a681","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v010","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"運動中心方案 A 年費 1200 元、每次 80 元；方案 B 無年費、每次 140 元。若一年使用 25 次，哪個方案較省，省多少？","choices":["A 省 500 元","A 省 300 元","B 省 300 元","兩者同價"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"方案 A 總費用為固定年費加使用費，1200+80×25=3200 元；方案 B 為 140×25=3500 元。比較後 A 少 3500−3200=300 元。兩方案都以二十五次完整計費，不能只拿每次單價比較而漏掉固定年費。","steps":["計算方案 A：1200+80×25=3200 元。","計算方案 B：140×25=3500 元。","比較差額 3500−3200=300 元，判定 A 較省。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"A 省 500 元","truth":false,"reason":"差額不是500。"},{"choice":"A 省 300 元","truth":true,"reason":"A省300元。"},{"choice":"B 省 300 元","truth":false,"reason":"方向相反。"},{"choice":"兩者同價","truth":false,"reason":"兩方案差300。"}],"commonMistake":"只比較每次八十元與一百四十元，沒有把方案 A 的固定年費納入總成本。","concept":"固定費用與按次費用都要計入總成本。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"費率方案比較。","literacyContextNecessity":"年費、每次費用與使用次數三項資料共同決定兩方案總價。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"8daa462d852ecfced1137d73adbd7aa732b6cca1f289e3f9754ff4dbf13024ce","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v011","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"水庫容量 800 萬噸，目前有 65%，預計再增加目前水量的 1/4。增加後約佔容量多少？","choices":["70%","75%","81.25%","90%"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"目前水量佔容量 65%，再增加『目前水量』的 1/4，表示把現有比例乘 1.25。65%×1.25=81.25%，所以增加後約佔容量 81.25%。增加量是容量的百分之十六點二五，和原比例相加也得相同結果。","steps":["把目前水量表示為容量的 65%。","增加目前的 1/4，使用倍率 1.25。","計算 65%×1.25=81.25%。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"70%","truth":false,"reason":"只加5個百分點。"},{"choice":"75%","truth":false,"reason":"把1/4當10%。"},{"choice":"81.25%","truth":true,"reason":"81.25%正確。"},{"choice":"90%","truth":false,"reason":"把增加量當容量1/4。"}],"commonMistake":"把目前水量的四分之一誤作總容量的四分之一，直接在百分之六十五上加二十五個百分點。","concept":"比例增量的基準是目前量。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"容量比例的變動基準。","literacyContextNecessity":"容量、目前比例與『目前水量的四分之一』共同決定新佔比，基準不得替換。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"ddbd58d3e604c31742fb492af506741e31fe6f5fa5e592e0c49630ae2f2ae8ca","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v012","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"展場甲區每 20 分鐘導覽一次，乙區每 30 分鐘一次。上午 9:00 同時開始。小明 10:05 到場，最少等多久可遇到下一次兩區同時開始？","choices":["15 分鐘","25 分鐘","45 分鐘","55 分鐘"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"20 與 30 的最小公倍數是 60 分鐘，從 9:00 起共同時刻為 10:00、11:00。小明 10:05 才到，已錯過 10:00，下一次是 11:00，需等 55 分鐘。共同週期仍從九點的既定時刻起算，不能改從小明到達時重新計時。","steps":["求 lcm(20,30)=60 分鐘。","由 9:00 列共同時刻 10:00、11:00。","計算 11:00−10:05=55 分鐘。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"15 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"10:20只有甲區。"},{"choice":"25 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"10:30只有乙區。"},{"choice":"45 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"10:50不是共同時刻。"},{"choice":"55 分鐘","truth":true,"reason":"到11:00等55分鐘。"}],"commonMistake":"從到場的十點零五分重新加六十分鐘，沒有對齊上午九點形成的共同時刻序列。","concept":"週期時刻需以已知共同起點建立時間軸。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"同步週期與等待時間。","literacyContextNecessity":"兩區週期、共同起點與到場時刻共同決定下一同步點及等待時間。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"42a796f0c67f66b618a024e35f51a744ae0ea37e5d69dcbe750256b82d9524d8","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1"}
